<title>UK: SULLOM VOE CRUDE LIFTINGS RISE, BULK GO TO EUROPE.</title>
<headline>SULLOM VOE CRUDE LIFTINGS RISE, BULK GO TO EUROPE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal jumped to 814,754 tonnes in the week ending August 12 from 518,265 tonnes the previous week, the port said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The vast majority of the barrels, over 80 percent, stayed in Europe and only one vessel sailed for the U.S.</p>
